  /usage limit/i, /message limit/i, /hit (the|your) .*(limit|cap)/i,
  /reached (the|your) .*(limit|cap)/i, /limit will reset/i, /resets? (on|at|in)/i,
  /upgrade to (pro|max|team)/i, /approaching your .*limit/i,
